Reviewing MSVC part.

I have tested this series as a whole - verified (on arm64) that
openvpn.exe, openvpnserv.exe and tapctl.exe binaries indeed work and
compiler/linker options do match ones generated by the original msvc build.

t_client windows test, which installs MSI and uses openvpn-gui to
start-stop connections, also succeeded:
https://github.com/OpenVPN/openvpn-build/actions/runs/5322740791/jobs/96401=
27504#step:6:417

